From c5dc678a723bcade77ef0b20a8b7ff277757ee95 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "yanan.he" <yanan.he@linux.alibaba.com>
Date: Wed, 10 Jun 2026 18:11:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] riscv: add cache subsystem support

Backport mainline RISC-V cache infrastructure to v2024.10 and add
XuanTie vendor-specific runtime cache detection.

1. insn-def.h (mainline bfc8ca3f7f): instruction definition macros for
   generating I-type instructions via .insn directive.

2. Zicbom CBO (mainline 9e859849e2): cache block operations
   (cbo.flush/cbo.inval) in arch/riscv/lib/cache.c with
   RISCV_ISA_ZICBOM Kconfig.

3. XTheadCMO shared library (mainline 3dbff9eecc): move T-Head
   non-standard cache ops from cv1800b/cache.c to shared
   lib/thead_cmo.c, controlled by SYS_CACHE_THEAD_CMO Kconfig.

4. XuanTie runtime detection: arch/riscv/cpu/xuantie/ vendor directory
   with mvendorid/marchid/mimpid-based CPU detection (SBI in S-mode,
   CSR in M-mode):
   - Legacy C9xx (c906/c910/c920): XuanTie custom cache instructions
   - Newer cores (c920v2/c925/c930/c950): standard Zicbom CBO
   Detection cached in .data section (safe before BSS init).

Signed-off-by: yanan.he <yanan.he@linux.alibaba.com>
